        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "B. The Association acknowledges and recognizes the School Board of Orange County, Florida, as the duly elected representative of the people of Orange County, Florida, and agrees to negotiate with the Chief Executive Officer or his representative pursuant to the provisions of Part II, Chapter 447, Florida Statutes.",
