        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "C. The bargaining unit shall be defined as set forth by the Public Employees Relations Commission in Case Number 8H-RC-754-1039, Certificate Number 27, CERTIFICATION OF REPRESENTATION FOLLOWING ELECTION AND ORDER TO NEGOTIATE issued by the Florida Public Employees Relations Commission on the twenty-first day of May, 1975, to wit:",
